{"nodes": [{"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_cangkang_paket", "label": "Cangkang Paket Modul (paket-shell)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Satu berkas HTML memuat dashboard plus seluruh modul yang ditanam; tiga konsep tata letak tinggal di berkas yang sama karena CSS konsep tak terpakai hanya belasan KB, tidak sebanding dengan risiko memangkas HTML/CSS secara aman, sementara modul tertanam ribuan kali lebih besar."}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_konsep", "label": "Konstanta KONSEP (dipatok saat export)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "var KONSEP = '__PAKET_KONSEP__'", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Perakit menuliskan nilainya saat export; KONSEP memilih satu dari tiga seksi tata letak dan menyetel atribut data-konsep di <html> yang menukar seluruh token warna."}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_modul", "label": "MODUL (daftar ringan nama+desc)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "var MODUL = __PAKET_MODUL__", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Metadata ringan dipisah dari ISI yang berat supaya pencarian dan render daftar tidak perlu menyentuh HTML modul utuh."}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_isi", "label": "ISI (HTML utuh tiap modul)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "var ISI = [ __PAKET_ISI__ ]", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_buka", "label": "buka()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function buka(i)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_document_write_bukan_blob", "label": "document.write ke tab baru, bukan blob: URL", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "komentar di atas function buka(i)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tab dari about:blank mewarisi origin halaman paket, jadi localStorage modul tetap terbaca - progres baca dan identitas peserta (Nama/NIP yang dipakai bersama antar modul) tetap nyambung. Lewat blob: origin-nya jadi buram dan keduanya hilang diam-diam."}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_renderpanel", "label": "renderPanel()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function renderPanel(k)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_renderindeks", "label": "renderIndeks()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function renderIndeks(k)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_previewindeks", "label": "previewIndeks()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function previewIndeks(m,i,row)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pratinjau hidup saat baris disorot (mouseenter/focus), bukan hanya saat diklik, supaya keterangan modul terbaca tanpa meninggalkan daftar."}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_buildorbit", "label": "buildOrbit()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function buildOrbit()", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_layoutorbit", "label": "layoutOrbit()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function layoutOrbit()", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Di bawah 780px cincin dilipat jadi daftar vertikal: metafora orbit gugur, keterbacaan menang."}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_fokusorbit", "label": "fokusOrbit()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function fokusOrbit(m,el)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_resetorbit", "label": "resetOrbit()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function resetOrbit()", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_stars", "label": "stars()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function stars()", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kanvas bintang hanya digambar bila KONSEP==='orbit'; pada konsep lain kanvas langsung disembunyikan."}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_toast", "label": "toast()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function toast(p)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_cocok", "label": "cocok() - penyaring pencarian modul", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "source_location": "function cocok(m,k)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "app_src_paket_paket_shell_pintasan_papan_ketik", "label": "Pintasan papan ketik / dan Escape", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/src/paket/paket-shell.html", "sourc